# Upstream ERT tests that must pass under clemacs.
#
# Test names must correspond to `ert-deftest` forms that are loaded by the
# upstream ERT bring-up harness (`mise run clemacs:test:ert-upstream`).
#
# Keep this list monotonic during bring-up; move temporary failures to
# `ert-upstream.known-fail.tests` with a short reason + date.
#
# NOTE: `ert-test-abc`/`ert-test-def` are defined dynamically inside
# `ert-test-deftest`.  We include them here, but they are order-dependent: keep
# them after `ert-test-deftest` in this list.
